  "description": "Make your API docs actually useful. OpenApiExamples adds real request and response examples to the OpenAPI document ASP.NET Core generates for your minimal API endpoints, rendered by Swagger UI and Scalar. Write a small provider class, attach it to an endpoint with RequestExample<T> or ResponseExample<T>, and you are done. One example or many named ones, per endpoint or per route group, JSON and XML built in, any other content type through your own formatter, providers resolved from DI, and zero runtime cost because examples are written when the document is generated.",
